@startuml US_3_2_6_C2_Logica
title US 3.2.6 - Lógica de fluxo de ativação

component Admin as "Admin envia link (US 3.2.5)"
component User as "Utilizador"
component ActCtrl as "ActivationController"
component ActSvc as "ActivationLinkService"
component IAM as "IAM Provider (OIDC)"
database DB as "PortContext"

Admin --> ActSvc : criar token (prévio)
User --> ActCtrl : /activation/start?token=...
ActCtrl --> IAM : redirect OIDC
IAM --> ActCtrl : callback
ActCtrl --> ActSvc : RedeemAsync(token, email/sub)
ActSvc --> DB : ativar AppUser, carimbar token
ActCtrl --> User : redirect frontend success/erro

@enduml
